<title>SPAIN: Spain's July trade deficit 222.2 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's July trade deficit 222.2 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The customs department of the economy ministry gave the following figures (billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE	     JUL 96	 JUN 96	 JUL 95</p>
<p> Exports			1,085.6    1,100.7	  863.1</p>
<p> Imports			1,307.8    1,315.7	1,100.3</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	     222.2	-215.0	 -237.2</p>
<p> Deficit yr to date	 1,556.1    1,334.0     -1,658.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are customs-cleared data.</p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE (EU)	JUL 96	 JUN 96	 JUL 95</p>
<p> Exports			737.1	  790.0	  607.0</p>
<p> Imports			852.6	  879.3	  678.7</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	   -115.5	  -89.3	  -71.7</p>
<p> Def/surplus yr to date  -514.6	 -399.0	 -564.7</p>
</text>
